{"id":"n87966-2-6","stage":2,"title":"혼나다 · 被大骂","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87966-2-6-1","ko":"오늘 숙제를 안 해 갔다며?","zh":"今天你说没做作业就去学校了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"숙제를","meaning":"作业","explanation":"숙제：作业；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65226","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙제를","audio":"/audio/029ebc8300fce395704c.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"갔다며?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔다며","audio":"/audio/e35dcc717b57e67f347a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"b33db886cc66d392","term":"숙제","zh":"作业","audio":"/audio/b